<title>INDIA: Indian repos rate hiked to five percent.</title>
<headline>Indian repos rate hiked to five percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Thursday it set a cur-off rate of five percent at the four-day repos auction of government of India securities, up from 4.90 percent at the previous auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 48 bids for 29.40 billion rupees of which it accepted 14 for 14.80 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off price worked out to 4.9213 percent, the RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
